@cc [owner:aubin-tchoi,label:error-handling] standalone-cli-errors
Within this standalone CLI, invalid input, failed HTTP requests, invalid model output, and invalid
saved artifacts may throw Error. Only the CLI entry point may catch those errors to print a message
and exit nonzero; library callers must propagate them.

@cc [owner:aubin-tchoi,label:security] tag-inputs-semantic-fields-only
Text sent to the tagging model and persisted in snapshots must contain only skill names,
descriptions, instructions, and enabled tool names and descriptions. Credentials, headers,
argument schemas, timestamps, and internal IDs other than the skill sId must never be included.
